<title>UK: BTP names Laporte exec as finance director.</title>
<headline>BTP names Laporte exec as finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British chemicals group BTP Plc said on Tuesday it had named Laporte Plc executive Ken Greatbatch as its finance director after Rob Martin resigned from the post.</p>
</text>
